  "description": "DEKXEZ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C228 H277 Eu5 O48 Ti4. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 6 O neighbors; Ti1 (Ti) has 6 O neighbors; Ti2 (Ti) has 6 O neighbors; Eu1F (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2F (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Ti1F (Ti) has 6 O neighbors; Ti2F (Ti) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 16 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.353-4.125 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.09-133.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Eu5Ti4(μ3-O)6(tbba)20(Htbba)(THF)2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
